UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under Section 469 and IRC Sec. 652(b), rental income retains its character as passive income when distributed from a trust to a beneficiary. The beneficiary must treat the $16,000 as passive income, which can offset passive losses but is subject to passive activity limitations.
Wrong (B): Portfolio income includes dividends, interest, and capital gains from investments, not rental income. Rental activity is specifically classified as passive under Section 469.
